*DefaultZebraSpeed: 4
*ZebraSpeed 2/2 ips - Slowest (best quality): ""
*ZebraSpeed 3/3 ips - Slow: ""
*ZebraSpeed 4/4 ips - Normal: ""
*ZebraSpeed 5/5 ips - Fast: ""
*ZebraSpeed 6/6 ips - Fastest: ""
